WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Look at this page. Your task is simple: find every date.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A moment later, someone asks what changed in the margin.
You may have read every line you were assigned and still missed the detail beside it.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Psychologists call one version of this inattentional blindness.
In a study of radiologists, many missed an unexpected gorilla while searching medical images.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
That does not make them poor doctors.
It means attention has a task.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
See the original studies and their limits in the Mind Archive.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Then try a free observation ledger before buying any attention tool.
